msgstr "开关机选项"

msgid "Show the manufacturer logo on the boot and shutdown screen. Changing this requires administrator authentication and may take some time."
msgstr "在开关机画面中显示厂商 Logo。修改时需要管理员认证，并可能需要一些时间。"

msgid "Only affects the boot and shutdown screen. Changes require administrator authentication and update initramfs."
msgstr "仅影响开关机画面；修改需要管理员认证并更新 initramfs。"

msgid "The manufacturer logo is hidden."
msgstr "当前已隐藏厂商 Logo。"

msgid "The manufacturer logo is visible."
msgstr "当前显示厂商 Logo。"

msgid "Set a boot image before changing the manufacturer logo."
msgstr "请先设置开关机画面，再更改厂商 Logo。"

msgid "Show manufacturer logo"
msgstr "显示厂商 Logo"

msgid "Apply the selected image to Plymouth when updating the background."
msgstr "应用背景时，将所选图片同时设置到 Plymouth。"

msgid "Hide manufacturer logo"
msgstr "隐藏厂商 Logo"

msgid "Hide firmware logos such as HUAWEI on the boot screen."
msgstr "隐藏开机画面中的 HUAWEI 等固件 Logo。"

msgid "Image folder"
msgstr "图片文件夹"

