msgstr "启动时检查，并在 Bing 发布下一张图片时再次检查。"

msgid "Recent images"
msgstr "最近图片天数"

msgid "Bing provides up to the most recent 8 daily images."
msgstr "Bing 最多提供最近 8 天的每日图片。"

msgid "Manual download"
msgstr "手动下载"

msgid "Download now"
msgstr "立即下载"

